{"text":"You wake up in the middle of the night, you hear a bump in the middle of the night. What's the first thing you do? You wake the person next to you. And then what do they do? They go. And if there's nothing there, you go and trust your eyes, right? You go looking for it, we're visual animals, right? If there's nothing there, you go like this. Cortisol leaves our body and we relax and our heartbeat goes back down. Cortisol, to get all of that extra energy, to make us paranoid, to make us self-interested, it needs to shut down non-essential systems because it has to get it from somewhere, right? So it shuts off things like growth. You don't need your fingernails to grow at that moment. It shuts it off. The other thing it shuts off is our immune system.","words":[{"text":"You","start":0.36,"end":0.68},{"text":"wake","start":0.68,"end":0.82},{"text":"up","start":0.82,"end":0.94},{"text":"in","start":0.94,"end":1.02},{"text":"the","start":1.02,"end":1.08},{"text":"middle","start":1.08,"end":1.2},{"text":"of","start":1.2,"end":1.32},{"text":"the","start":1.32,"end":1.36},{"text":"night","start":1.36,"end":1.46,"punct":","},{"text":"you","start":1.56,"end":1.6},{"text":"hear","start":1.6,"end":1.74},{"text":"a","start":1.74,"end":1.88},{"text":"bump","start":1.88,"end":2.02},{"text":"in","start":2.02,"end":2.2},{"text":"the","start":2.2,"end":2.26},{"text":"middle","start":2.26,"end":2.36},{"text":"of","start":2.36,"end":2.5},{"text":"the","start":2.5,"end":2.54},{"text":"night","start":2.54,"end":2.8,"punct":"."},{"text":"What's","start":3.36,"end":3.68},{"text":"the","start":3.68,"end":3.78},{"text":"first","start":3.78,"end":3.92},{"text":"thing","start":3.92,"end":4.06},{"text":"you","start":4.06,"end":4.16},{"text":"do","start":4.16,"end":4.4,"punct":"?"},{"text":"You","start":4.94,"end":5.1},{"text":"wake","start":5.1,"end":5.3},{"text":"the","start":5.3,"end":5.5},{"text":"person","start":5.5,"end":5.8},{"text":"next","start":5.8,"end":6.02},{"text":"to","st